{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of a heavily armed, freedom-loving squid and blast your way through destructible worlds. Soar through the air, tunnel through dirt and rock with powerful weaponry, and outmaneuver enemies across towering landscapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level is a playground of destruction \u2014 carve your own paths, uncover hidden areas, and rain chaos from above. Collect resources, swap weapons on the fly, and adapt your tactics to survive intense encounters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully destructible terrain</strong> \u2013 Make your own routes, uncover secrets, and obliterate anything in your way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fluid aerial movement</strong> \u2013 Hover, weave, and dodge while firing in any direction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic combat</strong> \u2013 Master multiple weapon types, from rapid-fire blasters to heavy-hitting explosives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging vertical levels</strong> \u2013 Conquer towering cliffs, deep caverns, and wide-open skies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect and upgrade</strong> \u2013 Gather resources to enhance your squid\u2019s combat potential.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freedom isn\u2019t given \u2014 it\u2019s taken. Tentacle by tentacle.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2113750?t=1768494885","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2113750?t=1768494885","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2113750/9fcfd01e9486fd7625c52bc15ad3fecb2cb0ba09/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768494885","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2113750/9fcfd01e94